    "All 71 reviewed edits reproduce the selected full source and invert to the accepted predecessor; the sole changed helper inventories both retained phases.",
    "The 21 helpers and three complete history, Git-attribute/blob and create-only regions remain byte-identical. The candidate only invokes read-only Git commands and has no target execution.",
    "All 125 original proof/control/group files and 15 additional authorities still match their complete directory inventory and pins. Installed binaries and cache subtrees are excluded from the archive and are not modified.",
    "Both original before/final pairs are fully byte-equal with the selected raw pins. The unchanged gzip helper selects an empty name, mtime zero and level nine; the candidate requires header, full decompression and second-encoding equality. This peer performed no compression or preparer execution.",
    "Historical BuildQuery metadata and negative runtime are independently matched to actual captures. The accepted later Chrome PID reuse remains represented, while strict runtime retains all 18 failure flags, one pass and nonempty stderr.",
    "The current unissued configuration fails the explicit status/authorization gate and has no fixture commit or intake authority. The future single fixture commit, exact parent/raw Git/pathspec/message/donor/current pins, independent source/intake peers and release/receipt bindings must pass before any output.",
    "The progress successor only appends the full prior checkpoint and bounded records, preserves every nested historical list prefix and unrelated field, and requires complete structural/raw-byte inverse. Fresh V37 actual metadata stays unknown; original 4+63 and 58+1249 cohorts remain.",
    "All filesystem writes in the preparer occur after final validations in the fixed new evidence directory with exclusive file creation; Main/index/cache remain untouched. Separate Root execution and later source-intake authority are required."
